{"seq":1,"slug":"direct-transit-time-sla","title":"直邮时效 SLA 与异常监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-mail-ops/direct-transit-time-sla","wordCount":2343,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"直邮时效-sla-与异常监控\">直邮时效 SLA 与异常监控</h1><p>「7 日达」这类承诺在直邮业务里是最难兑现的一类 SLA，因为它跨越了四段互不控制的网络：境外承运人、国际干线航班、进口口岸海关、境内派送商。任何一段出问题，整条承诺就破了，而平台通常对其中三段只有间接影响力。因此直邮时效监控的核心不是「考核承运商」，而是<strong>把不可控变成可观测、把可观测变成可预期</strong>。</p>\n<p>本篇讲直邮时效的分解模型、SLA 的定义方式、异常检测与归因、以及超时的补偿策略。时效计时如何与海关查验交互见 <a href=\"../direct-clear-status/inspect-tax-supplement\">抽检/补税/扣货处置</a>，通道与路径的成本侧见 <a href=\"../direct-mail-mode/direct-mail-linehaul-port\">国际干线与口岸选择</a>，退运对时效的影响见 <a href=\"../direct-clear-status/direct-return-shipback\">退运与拒收回流</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-时效的四段分解\">核心概念：时效的四段分解</h2><p>端到端时效必须拆成可独立测量的段，否则无法归因。直邮的四段与它们各自的可控性如下。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分段</th>\n<th>起点事件</th>\n<th>终点事件</th>\n<th>主要责任方</th>\n<th>平台可控性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>集货段</td>\n<td>消费者下单</td>\n<td>出境交寄扫描</td>\n<td>平台 / 境外仓</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线段</td>\n<td>出境交寄</td>\n<td>到港扫描</td>\n<td>承运人 / 航空公司</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>清关段</td>\n<td>到港</td>\n<td>海关放行</td>\n<td>海关 / 报关代理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>派送段</td>\n<td>放行</td>\n<td>妥投签收</td>\n<td>境内派送商</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「平台可控性」这一列是监控设计的依据：可控性高的段应当设严格的内部 KPI，可控性低的段应当设阈值告警而非考核。把清关段的时长拿来考核承运商，只会得到一堆无法改善的投诉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"各段的测量口径\">各段的测量口径</h3><p>每一段的起止事件必须来自<strong>同一套扫描事件源</strong>，否则段与段之间会出现时间空洞或重叠。工程上要求所有承运人回传标准化的轨迹事件，这件事本身在 <a href=\"../carrier-tracking-event-standardization/\">承运商物流轨迹事件标准化</a> 里有完整讨论；本 hub 只关心这些事件如何喂给时效模型。</p>\n<p>集货段的终点判定尤其容易歧义：「出境交寄」到底以承运人的揽收扫描为准，还是以航空公司的收运扫描为准？两者可能相差数天。系统必须在路径配置里明确每一段的锚点事件类型（见 <a href=\"../direct-mail-mode/direct-mail-linehaul-port\">国际干线与口岸选择</a> 中的路由表），否则各段时长不可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sla-的定义方式\">SLA 的定义方式</h2><h3 id=\"用分位数而非平均值承诺\">用分位数而非平均值承诺</h3><p>「平均 7 日达」是一个没有意义的承诺。时效分布是右偏的——大部分包裹在 5–7 天，长尾拖到 20 天以上。平均值会被长尾拉高，而消费者感知的是「我的这一单有没有按时到」。</p>\n<p>正确的承诺口径是分位数：例如「90 分位在 8 日内妥投」。这个承诺的含义是 90% 的订单在 8 日内完成，剩下的 10% 需要补偿机制覆盖。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(T \\le T_{sla}) \\ge p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 是端到端时长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{sla}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是承诺时限，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 是分位目标。监控的任务就是持续估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(T \\le T_{sla})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 并及时发现它跌破 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分位数不能按天算\">分位数不能按天算</h3><p>日粒度的分位数在低单量下噪声极大，且分位数本身是有偏估计。工程上的做法是用<strong>滚动窗口</strong>（例如 7 日或 14 日）计算，并对窗口内的样本量设最低要求——样本不足时不出指标，而不是出一个不可信的指标。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 滚动窗口内的达标率与分位数（PostgreSQL）&#10;SELECT&#10;  route_id,&#10;  date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, delivered_at) AS d,&#10;  count(*)                                            AS n,&#10;  percentile_cont(0.90) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY total_hours) AS p90_hours,&#10;  avg(CASE WHEN total_hours &lt;= sla_hours THEN 1.0 ELSE 0.0 END) AS on_time_rate&#10;FROM order_transit_fact&#10;WHERE delivered_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;14 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY route_id, date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, delivered_at)&#10;HAVING count(*) &gt;= 30&#10;ORDER BY route_id, d;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 滚动窗口内的达标率与分位数（PostgreSQL）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  route_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delivered_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                            </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_hours) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> p90_hours,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_hours </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sla_hours </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_time_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_transit_fact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delivered_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'14 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route_id, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, delivered_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> route_id, d;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>HAVING count(*) &gt;= 30</code> 是必要的——没有这个门槛，节假日低单量日的分位数会剧烈波动并触发误告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常检测的三类信号\">异常检测的三类信号</h2><p>时效异常不是单一指标，至少有三类信号需要独立监控。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分段时长漂移\">分段时长漂移</h3><p>某一段的中位数或 90 分位持续上升，说明该段出现了系统性劣化。这是最有价值的信号，因为它能在端到端 SLA 破线之前预警。</p>\n<p>漂移检测用同比或环比更稳健：把当周的分位数与过去 4 周同期的中位数比较，超过阈值即告警。绝对值阈值会被季节因素干扰。</p>\n<h3 id=\"停滞包裹堆积\">停滞包裹堆积</h3><p>包裹在某个状态停留超过阈值数量激增，说明该环节堵塞。这与分段时长漂移不同：漂移是「变慢了」，堆积是「卡住了」。堆积检测要按「当前状态 × 停留时长」分桶统计。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 停滞包裹分桶：按当前状态统计停留超过阈值的件数&#10;SELECT&#10;  current_status,&#10;  CASE&#10;    WHEN now() - status_since &gt; interval &#39;3 days&#39;  THEN &#39;3d+&#39;&#10;    WHEN now() - status_since &gt; interval &#39;48 hours&#39; THEN &#39;2-3d&#39;&#10;    WHEN now() - status_since &gt; interval &#39;24 hours&#39; THEN &#39;1-2d&#39;&#10;    ELSE &#39;under-1d&#39;&#10;  END AS dwell_bucket,&#10;  count(*) AS cnt&#10;FROM shipment_state_view&#10;WHERE is_terminal = false&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2&#10;ORDER BY 1, 2;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 停滞包裹分桶：按当前状态统计停留超过阈值的件数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  current_status,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'3 days'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '3d+'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2-3d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> status_since </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '1-2d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'under-1d'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dwell_bucket,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shipment_state_view</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_terminal </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个查询的产物直接驱动运营动作：某个状态出现大量 3d+ 的包裹，就该有人去看那个环节。</p>\n<h3 id=\"轨迹断点\">轨迹断点</h3><p>包裹长时间没有新的扫描事件，不代表它在移动——也可能是事件没有回传。轨迹断点是数据质量问题，不是物流问题，但两者的表现完全一样（都是「没有新事件」）。系统必须能区分：若同一批次的其他包裹在同一承运人处有正常事件，则断点是数据问题；若整批都没有事件，则是真实的物流中断。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>归因方向</th>\n<th>处置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分段漂移</td>\n<td>分位数环比上升超阈值</td>\n<td>该段能力下降</td>\n<td>排查承运人/口岸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>停滞堆积</td>\n<td>某状态停留超阈值件数激增</td>\n<td>环节堵塞</td>\n<td>人工介入疏通</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>轨迹断点</td>\n<td>超时无新事件</td>\n<td>数据问题或真实中断</td>\n<td>按同批次对照判定</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"超时的补偿策略\">超时的补偿策略</h2><p>SLA 破线后的处置要分层，按超时时长与原因给不同补偿。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补偿应当与可控性对齐\">补偿应当与可控性对齐</h3><p>对清关段造成的超时，平台无法向承运人索赔，也不该向消费者解释「海关的问题」——消费者只认平台的承诺。因此补偿策略应当是：<strong>平台先行补偿消费者，再按合同向责任方追偿（若可追偿）</strong>。这两件事在系统里是两条独立流程。</p>\n<h3 id=\"补偿分层\">补偿分层</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>超时时长</th>\n<th>补偿动作</th>\n<th>是否自动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>超过承诺 1–3 日</td>\n<td>优惠券 / 积分</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超过承诺 3–7 日</td>\n<td>部分退款</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超过承诺 7 日以上</td>\n<td>全额退款或弃件重发</td>\n<td>需人工审核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>已确认丢失</td>\n<td>全额退款</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「已确认丢失」应当有独立的判定逻辑，不能简单等同于「超时很久」。丢失的判定通常要求承运人出具查询结论，这个结论要作为凭证落库——与 <a href=\"../direct-clear-status/inspect-tax-supplement\">抽检/补税/扣货处置</a> 中的凭证留存是同一套要求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[妥投/超时事件] --&gt; B{是否超 SLA}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[正常结单]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[计算超时时长]&#10;  D --&gt; E{超时是否已结束}&#10;  E --&gt;|仍在途| F[持续补偿 优惠券]&#10;  E --&gt;|已妥投超时| G[按分层补偿]&#10;  E --&gt;|确认丢失| H[全额退款]&#10;  G --&gt; I[按责任段归因]&#10;  I --&gt; J{可否追偿}&#10;  J --&gt;|可| K[向责任方索赔]&#10;  J --&gt;|不可| L[计入平台成本]\">graph TD\n  A[妥投/超时事件] --&gt; B{是否超 SLA}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[正常结单]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[计算超时时长]\n  D --&gt; E{超时是否已结束}\n  E --&gt;|仍在途| F[持续补偿 优惠券]\n  E --&gt;|已妥投超时| G[按分层补偿]\n  E --&gt;|确认丢失| H[全额退款]\n  G --&gt; I[按责任段归因]\n  I --&gt; J{可否追偿}\n  J --&gt;|可| K[向责任方索赔]\n  J --&gt;|不可| L[计入平台成本]</pre><h3 id=\"补偿触发要及时\">补偿触发要及时</h3><p>补偿的价值随时间衰减。消费者在超时第 8 天收到优惠券的满意度，远低于第 3 天收到。因此补偿不能等结单后批量跑，应当在超时判定成立时立即触发一次、结单时再结算差额。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时效数据的留存与口径一致性\">时效数据的留存与口径一致性</h2><h3 id=\"口径必须唯一\">口径必须唯一</h3><p>时效数据最怕的是「同一个指标在不同报表里数字不同」。避免这个问题的做法是建一张<strong>唯一的时效事实表</strong>，所有报表从它派生，而不是各自从订单表 join 计算。</p>\n<p>事实表应当在包裹终态时一次性生成，字段包括：订单号、路径、各段起止时间、各段暂停时长、端到端有效时长、是否达标、超时原因分类。生成后不再修改。</p>\n<h3 id=\"暂停时长的正确扣除\">暂停时长的正确扣除</h3><p>端到端有效时长不等于墙钟时长。查验、补税等待、扣货期间的时间不计入承运商可影响的时长（见 <a href=\"../direct-clear-status/inspect-tax-supplement\">抽检/补税/扣货处置</a> 中的时效暂停语义）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{effective} = T_{wall} - T_{paused}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个扣减必须在事实表生成时完成并落库，而不是在查询时计算——因为暂停记录可能被后续操作追加，查询时计算会导致同一历史指标在不同时刻不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间戳的时区纪律\">时间戳的时区纪律</h3><p>所有时间戳按 <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3339.txt\">RFC 3339</a> 规范存储，带 <code>Z</code> 或数字偏移。该规范明确「<code>Applications that generate this format SHOULD use upper case letters</code>」，且不带时区的本地时间不可互操作。直邮链路跨多个时区，用本地时间存储会产生无法察觉的错误——例如跨零点的时长计算会差出 8 小时。</p>\n<p>存储层应当统一为 UTC，展示层按用户时区渲染。这一条在跨境场景下不是最佳实践而是必需项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>直邮时效必须拆成集货、干线、清关、派送四段独立测量，分段的责任方与可控性不同，考核与告警要分开设计。</li>\n<li>SLA 用分位数承诺（例如 90 分位 8 日内），不用平均值；分位数要用滚动窗口计算并对最小样本量设门槛。</li>\n<li>异常有三类信号：分段时长漂移、停滞包裹堆积、轨迹断点；断点需要按同批次对照区分数据问题与真实中断。</li>\n<li>补偿应与可控性对齐：平台先补偿消费者，再按合同向责任方追偿；补偿触发要即时而非结单后批量。</li>\n<li>时效口径必须唯一——建一张只在包裹终态生成、事后不改的事实表；暂停时长在生成时扣除；时间戳统一 UTC 存储。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"直邮时效 SLA 与异常监控","id":"直邮时效-sla-与异常监控"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：时效的四段分解","id":"核心概念-时效的四段分解"},{"level":3,"text":"各段的测量口径","id":"各段的测量口径"},{"level":2,"text":"SLA 的定义方式","id":"sla-的定义方式"},{"level":3,"text":"用分位数而非平均值承诺","id":"用分位数而非平均值承诺"},{"level":3,"text":"分位数不能按天算","id":"分位数不能按天算"},{"level":2,"text":"异常检测的三类信号","id":"异常检测的三类信号"},{"level":3,"text":"分段时长漂移","id":"分段时长漂移"},{"level":3,"text":"停滞包裹堆积","id":"停滞包裹堆积"},{"level":3,"text":"轨迹断点","id":"轨迹断点"},{"level":2,"text":"超时的补偿策略","id":"超时的补偿策略"},{"level":3,"text":"补偿应当与可控性对齐","id":"补偿应当与可控性对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"补偿分层","id":"补偿分层"},{"level":3,"text":"补偿触发要及时","id":"补偿触发要及时"},{"level":2,"text":"时效数据的留存与口径一致性","id":"时效数据的留存与口径一致性"},{"level":3,"text":"口径必须唯一","id":"口径必须唯一"},{"level":3,"text":"暂停时长的正确扣除","id":"暂停时长的正确扣除"},{"level":3,"text":"时间戳的时区纪律","id":"时间戳的时区纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"直邮退运与拒收回流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-clear-status/direct-return-shipback"},"next":{"title":"通道税费与时效的综合比价模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/direct-mail-postal-import-customs/direct-mail-ops/channel-tax-cost-compare"}}